---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Kenresoft CMS example">
  <h1>Kenresoft CMS + Astro</h1>
  <p>
    A minimal reference site that fetches from a Kenresoft CMS deployment's public API
    (<code>src/lib/cms.ts</code>) and statically renders the result — no admin credentials, no
    database access, just the same unauthenticated REST endpoints any visitor's browser could
    call directly.
  </p>
  <p><a href="/blog">See it in action: the blog list →</a></p>
</BaseLayout>
